---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Pic from '../components/Pic.astro';
---

<Layout title="15-Year Warranty | AZ Turf Suppliers — Queen Creek, AZ">
<style is:global>
.page-hero::before { background-image: url("/media/natural-series-turf-6.jpg") !important; }

/* ─── WARRANTY INTRO ─── */
.warranty-intro {
  padding: 88px 0;
  background: var(--white);
}
.warranty-intro-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  align-items: start;
}
.warranty-intro-content h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.warranty-intro-content > p {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--gray-600);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  font-weight: 400;
  text-transform: none;
  letter-spacing: 0;
}
.warranty-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background: var(--green-700);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 12px 24px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.warranty-doc-img {
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
}
.warranty-doc-img img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
.warranty-download {
  margin-top: 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  background: var(--gray-100);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  color: var(--dark);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  text-transform: none;
}
.warranty-download:hover { background: var(--green-700); color: var(--white); border-color: var(--green-700); }
.warranty-download svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }

/* ─── PRORATION ─── */
.proration {
  padding: 72px 0;
  background: var(--gray-100);
}
.proration-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.proration-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}
.proration-card .years {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--gray-600);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.proration-card .pct {
  font-size: 2.8rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--green-700);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.proration-card .pct-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--gray-600); margin-top: 6px; font-weight: 400; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }

/* ─── WARRANTY DETAIL ─── */
.warranty-detail {
  padding: 88px 0;
  background: var(--white);
}
.warranty-detail-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  margin-top: 48px;
}
.warranty-section h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--dark);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  padding-bottom: 12px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--green-700);
  display: inline-block;
}
.warranty-section p, .warranty-section li {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--gray-600);
  line-height: 1.75;
  font-weight: 400;
  text-transform: none;
  letter-spacing: 0;
}
.warranty-section ol {
  padding-left: 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}
.warranty-claim {
  margin-top: 48px;
  background: var(--gray-100);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
}
.warranty-claim h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--dark);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.warranty-claim p {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--gray-600);
  line-height: 1.75;
  font-weight: 400;
  text-transform: none;
  letter-spacing: 0;
}

/* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .warranty-intro-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .proration-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .warranty-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
}
</style>

<!-- ═══ PAGE HERO ═══ -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Product Guarantee</div>
      <h1>15-Year <em>Manufacturer</em> Warranty</h1>
      <p>Every turf product purchased from AZ Turf Suppliers is backed by a 15-year manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. We stand behind the quality of every roll we sell.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-btns">
        <a href="/media/15_year_warranty.pdf" download class="btn btn-primary">Download Warranty PDF <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">File a Claim</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ INTRO ═══ -->
<section class="warranty-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="warranty-intro-inner">
      <div class="warranty-intro-content" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-label">Our Promise</div>
        <h2>Built to Last. Backed in Writing.</h2>
        <div class="warranty-badge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="24" height="24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          15-Year Manufacturer Warranty
        </div>
        <p>AZ Turf Suppliers warrants that the artificial turf purchased will be free from defects for 15 years from the date of initial purchase, assuming proper care of the turf is maintained throughout the lifetime of the turf.</p>
        <p>The warranty covers the repair or replacement of the turf if it fails to meet manufacturer specifications within 15 years, subject to inspection, excluding installation costs. This warranty guarantees the issue of turf to replace any damaged product, but the removal of the affected turf and installation of the new turf will be the responsibility of the original purchaser.</p>
        <p>It is recognized that slight alterations to color over the lifetime of the turf is normal and recognizable as expected wear and tear and is not available as a basis of a claim. AZ Turf Suppliers reserves the right to inspect the turf prior to making any repairs or replacements.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="warranty-doc-img">
          <Pic name="turf_warranty.png" alt="AZ Turf Suppliers 15-Year Warranty Certificate" />
        </div>
        <a href="/media/15_year_warranty.pdf" download class="warranty-download">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
          Download Warranty Certificate (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ PRORATION ═══ -->
<section class="proration">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header centered">
      <div class="section-label centered">Coverage Over Time</div>
      <h2>Proration Schedule</h2>
      <p>Warranty coverage is prorated over the 15-year period as follows:</p>
    </div>
    <div class="proration-grid">
      <div class="proration-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="years">Years 1–8</div>
        <div class="pct">100<span style="font-size:1.6rem;">%</span></div>
        <div class="pct-label">Full coverage</div>
      </div>
      <div class="proration-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="years">Years 9–12</div>
        <div class="pct">50<span style="font-size:1.6rem;">%</span></div>
        <div class="pct-label">Partial coverage</div>
      </div>
      <div class="proration-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="years">Years 13–15</div>
        <div class="pct">25<span style="font-size:1.6rem;">%</span></div>
        <div class="pct-label">Final coverage</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ DETAIL ═══ -->
<section class="warranty-detail">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Full Terms</div>
      <h2>Warranty Details</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="warranty-detail-grid">
      <div class="warranty-section" data-reveal>
        <h3>Limitation of Coverage</h3>
        <p>The warranty does not cover:</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Burning, cutting, accidents, vandalism, abuse or neglect of maintenance</li>
          <li>Damage caused by sunlight, reflections from glass, fences or other reflecting surfaces. Damage caused by motor vehicles, animals, high friction sports equipment or excessive use of the site</li>
          <li>Improper cleaning methods including using cleaning agents, herbicides or pesticides that are corrosive to touch the lawn</li>
          <li>Damage caused by invasive vegetation, including nut grass, nut sage, roots and other similar growths</li>
          <li>Damage that occurs during shipping or transportation. Shipping claims must be taken up directly with the shipping company</li>
          <li>Failure to maintain infill products at the correct level</li>
          <li>Normal wear and tear — this is not a manufacturing defect and will not be covered by the warranty</li>
          <li>All other force majeure situations</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="warranty-section" data-reveal>
        <h3>Assignment</h3>
        <p>This warranty is non-transferable and applies only to the original purchaser of the product. AZ Turf Suppliers is not responsible for any damages or expenses resulting from the removal, transportation, or reinstallation of the turf.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">AZ Turf Suppliers is not liable for any incidental or consequential damages resulting from the use of the turf. This certificate constitutes the entire agreement between the customer and the company and supersedes all prior negotiations, representations, and agreements. This certificate may not be modified except in writing signed by both parties.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">Damage that takes place during installation — such as pile crushing, improper underlay, or damage from equipment when not installed by a professional — is not warranted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="warranty-claim" data-reveal>
      <h3>How to File a Claim</h3>
      <p>To make a claim, the customer must notify AZ Turf Suppliers in writing and include proof of installation, company name of installation, and product volume. Claims should be delivered to:<br><strong>18607 E San Tan Blvd, Queen Creek, AZ 85142</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CTA ═══ -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div class="section-label centered orange">Questions About Your Warranty?</div>
    <h2>We're Here to Help</h2>
    <p>Have a question about your warranty coverage or need to file a claim? Call or text us directly — we'll walk you through it.</p>
    <div class="cta-btns">
      <a href="tel:6025207511" class="btn btn-primary">Call or Text (602) 520-7511 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 12a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 1.21h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91A16 16 0 0 0 14 15.82l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg></a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
